The `REMOVE_MISSING` field is declared `public static` but is missing `final`. Every other shared constant in this class (`NOT_ACKNOWLEDGED`, `ACKNOWLEDGED_NO_ERRORS`, `ACTION_FIELD`, `SUCCESS_FIELD`, `ERROR_FIELD`) is `final`. Without `final`, the reference could be reassigned by any code in the same package or via reflection, silently breaking the "shared immutable sentinel" contract. It should be:
```java
public static final AliasActionResult REMOVE_MISSING = new AliasActionResult(
    AliasActions.Type.REMOVE,
    false,
    "aliases_not_found_exception"
);
```

